      "description": "About this app. Back to the main dashboard: https://grafana.npty.online/d/logs-at-a-glance",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Friendly Actual Budget** - the voice-budget API on Vercel (voice-budget.npty.online), shipping logs to K12 via OTLP since 2026-11-10. No Gatus endpoint (Vercel app, not k8s). Back to [Logs at a glance](https://grafana.npty.online/d/logs-at-a-glance).\n\n**Logging:** 1 line so far - the heartbeat from the deploy check. Receipt events (wallet-ingest-queued, transaction-confirmed) have 0 lines yet, because no real receipt has been saved since the OTel deploy. The code already emits them, so the next real PWA/iOS receipt will appear in the business panel automatically - no code change needed."
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.2.3"
    },
